			"Message": "docs(Cocoon): Refactor architectural documentation and update diagrams\n\nComprehensively rewrite the `README.md` to enhance clarity and structural accuracy. Replace the legacy feature list with detailed architectural descriptions for new modules including `Codegen`, `Platform`, `WebviewPanel`, `Telemetry`, and `Generated`. Expand the interaction flow section to explicitly trace the `gRPC` round-trip for `vscode.window.showInformationMessage` from the Extension Host through `Mountain`.\n\nUpdate the Mermaid architecture diagram to include the bidirectional `gRPC` server component, reflecting the dual-channel communication pattern (Client and Server) now active in the `Services/` layer. Add new nodes for `Platform`, `Telemetry`, and `WebviewPanel` to the `AppLayer` composition.\n\nStandardize inline code formatting and list structures throughout the document. Trigger a full rebuild to update `RouteManifest` timestamps, ensuring the generated `Target/` artifacts reflect the current `118` Mountain RPC methods and the latest build state.",
